RipsMath_CalculatePrizeAmount
├── when the prize number does not match any tier
│   └── it should return zero.
└── when the prize number matches a tier
    ├── when the tier has a single winner
    │   └── it should return the min prize.
    └── when the tier has multiple winners
        ├── when the prize is at the start of the tier
        │   └── it should return the min prize.
        ├── when the prize is at the end of the tier
        │   └── it should return the max prize.
        └── when the prize is in the middle of the tier
            └── it should linearly interpolate between min and max prize.
